OL,3,GNEWSAFour police officers suspended in
OL,4,Ainquiry into 'on-duty conduct'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour police officers in the north-east
OL,7,Fof Scotland have been suspended amid
OL,8,Finquiries into their "on-duty conduct".
OL,10,FThe Crown Office and Procurator Fiscal
OL,11,FService (COPFS) said it was aware of
OL,12,Fthe suspensions.
OL,14,FIt said the move had the potential to
OL,15,Fimpact cases where the officers were
OL,16,Frequired to give evidence.
OL,18,FInquiries by Police Scotland's
OL,19,FProfessional Standards Department (PSD)
OL,20,Fare ongoing. The reasons for the
OL,21,Fsuspensions have not been given.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
